This is a vm-display specialized for QNX 8.0 based on the Screen display API
and requires QNX includes & libraries.

Note:
  https://qnx.com/getqnx
  https://www.qnx.com/developers/docs/8.0/com.qnx.doc.screen/topic/manual/cscreen_about.html

Interaction is similar in pattern to vm-display-fbdev

WARNING: [Incomplete Work In Progress]
  displayTest -> paints single-screen display & drawns 5 Balloon images.
  screenTest -> as above, but also displays Keyboard and Mouse Pointer input

TESTED Raspberry Pi 5 Self hosted  [sudo apk add screen]
TESTED Ubunto/Mint Linux x86_64 ==cross-compiled==> QNX 8.0 Raspberry Pi 4 aarch64

